story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Mille Lacs County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, across 8 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, and in 2025 it ran 53% of normal. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 30746 lowest at 46%. A preliminary estimate for grid 31045 puts July to August 2026 at 63.0, ahead of RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
